  s3 --> s2: Device goes offline
  s3 --> s4: track refused or broken
  s3 --> s5: track opens
  s4 --> s1: handle fails
  s4 --> s2: Device goes offline
  s4 --> s3: presses Retry
  s5 --> s1: handle fails
  s5 --> s2: Device goes offline
  s5 --> s4: track refused or broken
  s5 --> s6: first keyframe decodes
